    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/05cc39f2e688856143c836915050fbb0.avif?t=1744621722\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cerebral Escape Series is an omnibus that contains 3 different, first-person horror escape room games. It covers the genres of sci-fi, occult, and psychological horror where you must utilize your deduction &amp; observation skills to solve thrilling puzzles, as well as rely on your survival instincts to make your escape. Each game comes with their own unique scenario, where you must use your wits to make your escape from. But along the way, there are forces and entities that seek to hold you within\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>3 Escape Rooms in 1</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/b206c6c4bb0c50eb1a63037961b6a444.poster.avif?t=1744621722\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/b206c6c4bb0c50eb1a63037961b6a444.webm?t=1744621722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/b206c6c4bb0c50eb1a63037961b6a444.mp4?t=1744621722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Splinters</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a strange office, with no memories of who you are and plagued by mysterious visions. As you try to make your way out, you are followed by an entity\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/0e174fe43b078675a8dd11ecbe28fc5b.poster.avif?t=1744621722\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/0e174fe43b078675a8dd11ecbe28fc5b.webm?t=1744621722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/0e174fe43b078675a8dd11ecbe28fc5b.mp4?t=1744621722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Anachron</u></strong> <br>Set in the far future of 2080, where humans have achieved space exploration and colonization. You  wake up in a space station after an incident has occurred. You have to survive and find your way out by solving multiple puzzles while making your way to the escape pods.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/539246a4699a863ee59219ae63e135aa.poster.avif?t=1744621722\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/539246a4699a863ee59219ae63e135aa.webm?t=1744621722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/539246a4699a863ee59219ae63e135aa.mp4?t=1744621722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Pagan</u></strong><br>You are  kidnapped by a demon-worshipping cult, and confined within an abandoned temple for their ritual. But when they lose control of the summoning, you are now also trapped here alongside a malevolent demon\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve, Survive, Escape, or else\u2026</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/05cc39f2e688856143c836915050fbb0.avif?t=1744621722\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cerebral Escape Series is an omnibus that contains 3 different, first-person horror escape room games. It covers the genres of sci-fi, occult, and psychological horror where you must utilize your deduction &amp; observation skills to solve thrilling puzzles, as well as rely on your survival instincts to make your escape. Each game comes with their own unique scenario, where you must use your wits to make your escape from. But along the way, there are forces and entities that seek to hold you within\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>3 Escape Rooms in 1</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/b206c6c4bb0c50eb1a63037961b6a444.poster.avif?t=1744621722\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/b206c6c4bb0c50eb1a63037961b6a444.webm?t=1744621722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/b206c6c4bb0c50eb1a63037961b6a444.mp4?t=1744621722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Splinters</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a strange office, with no memories of who you are and plagued by mysterious visions. As you try to make your way out, you are followed by an entity\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/0e174fe43b078675a8dd11ecbe28fc5b.poster.avif?t=1744621722\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/0e174fe43b078675a8dd11ecbe28fc5b.webm?t=1744621722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/0e174fe43b078675a8dd11ecbe28fc5b.mp4?t=1744621722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Anachron</u></strong> <br>Set in the far future of 2080, where humans have achieved space exploration and colonization. You  wake up in a space station after an incident has occurred. You have to survive and find your way out by solving multiple puzzles while making your way to the escape pods.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/539246a4699a863ee59219ae63e135aa.poster.avif?t=1744621722\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/539246a4699a863ee59219ae63e135aa.webm?t=1744621722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987870/extras/539246a4699a863ee59219ae63e135aa.mp4?t=1744621722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Pagan</u></strong><br>You are  kidnapped by a demon-worshipping cult, and confined within an abandoned temple for their ritual. But when they lose control of the summoning, you are now also trapped here alongside a malevolent demon\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve, Survive, Escape, or else\u2026</p>",
    "short_description": "The Cerebral Escape Series is an anthology of first-person horror escape room games. It contains 3 different games namely Anachron, Pagan &amp; Splinters. Utilize your deduction &amp; observation skills to solve puzzles, as well as rely on your survival instincts to make your escape.",
